# Pasta Pass Tracker
#
# The app ships as plain static files with no build step and no runtime
# dependencies, so there is very little to ignore. Everything below is either
# local tooling, editor noise, or generated at deploy time.

# --- Generated at deploy time by .github/workflows/deploy.yml ---
# Written into the Pages artifact so Settings can report the running build.
commit_hash.txt
build_date.txt

# --- Local tooling ---
# Nothing is needed to run or test the app, but keep stray installs out.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/

# --- Test and diagnostic artefacts ---
tests/**/screenshots/
*.local

# --- Environment and secrets ---
.env
.env.*

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editor and IDE ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
